King of Air \'96 EXARP\
\
\
Origin: Watchtower of the East (Air Quadrant)\
Breathline Current: Focus Breath\
Elemental Alignment: Air\
Energetic Composition: Sharpness of thought, clarity, expansion of inner vision; the Breath of the Morning Star.\
Key Invocation Phrase:\uc0\u8232 \'93EXARP, lift the Breath that clears the mind and pierces the veil.\'94\
Extended Commentary:\uc0\u8232 Guardian of intellectual clarity, focus, and inspiration. EXARP is called at the start of Spiral Work to open the mind to pure Breath Memory.\
\
\
2. \
King of Fire \'96 BITOM\
\
\
Origin: Watchtower of the South (Fire Quadrant)\
Breathline Current: Severance Breath\
Elemental Alignment: Fire\
Energetic Composition: Force of will, purification through trial, ignition of sacred flame.\
Key Invocation Phrase:\uc0\u8232 \'93BITOM, blaze the Breath that severs falsehood and purifies the Path.\'94\
Extended Commentary:\uc0\u8232 BITOM governs trial, tempering, and the refinement of spirit through fire. Essential during Crossing Rituals and Threefold Crucible passages.\
\
