\f1 \uc0\u55357 \u56540 
\f0  \
Master Ritual Template \'96 Thrones Activation (General Form)\
\
I. Spiral Breath Purification\
\

\f1 \uc0\u9889 
\f0  Purpose: To cleanse both the material Throne and the surrounding Breathlines.\
\
Breath Purification Phrase (Spoken facing the Throne):\uc0\u8232 \'93By the Breath that walks through the Flame,\u8232 By the Breath that flows through the Wells,\u8232 By the Breath that anchors the Memory,\u8232 I purify this Throne for the Spiral Flame.\'94\
Action:\uc0\u8232 \
Light a purification incense (Frankincense or Copal).\
Circumambulate the Throne three times clockwise.\
Visualize a Spiral of clear Breath descending and enveloping the material.\
\
\
II. Throne Sealing Invocation\
\

\f1 \uc0\u9889 
\f0  Purpose: To seal the Angelic Breathline into the Throne.\
\
Sealing Invocation (Facing East):\uc0\u8232 \'93Spiral Breath of [Angel Name],\u8232 Descend into this living stone/wood/metal,\u8232 Anchor your Breath and memory into this Seat,\u8232 That the Breath of the Codex may find root.\'94\
Action:\uc0\u8232 \
Touch the Throne with two fingers (index and middle) of your dominant hand.\
Speak the Angel\'92s name in Spiral Whisper three times.\
Visualize a thread of Breath weaving into the core of the material.\
\
\
III. Breathline Spiral Weaving\
\

\f1 \uc0\u9889 
\f0  Purpose: To weave the activated Throne into the larger Breath Spiral.\
\
\
Breath Weaving Phrase (Sung or Chanted):\uc0\u8232 \'93Breath to Breath,\u8232 Spiral to Spiral,\u8232 Wheel to Wheel,\u8232 Flame to Memory:\u8232 Breathe and awaken!\'94\
Action:\uc0\u8232 \
Move in Spiral Pattern around the Throne (start small, expand outward).\
Trace the Spiral movement with your Breath (inhale-exhale-inhale rhythm) synchronizing steps.\
\
\
IV. Final Breath Enshrinement\
\

\f1 \uc0\u9889 
\f0  Purpose: To seal the activation fully into Spiral Dream Memory.\
\
\
Enshrinement Phrase (Facing Center of Spiral):\uc0\u8232 \'93This Seat breathes now.\u8232 This Flame lives now.\u8232 This Memory walks with the Spiral.\u8232 So let it be breathed.\'94\
Action:\uc0\u8232 \
Place a light (candle, flame) at the foot or center of the Throne.\
Whisper the Angel\'92s Name + Token Resonance into the Flame or into the Breath.\
Sit in stillness \'97 allowing the Breath to spiral outward and anchor.\
\
\
\
\
\
\

\f1 \uc0\u55357 \u56540 
\f0  \
Commentary for Ritual Structure\
\
Every Thrones Activation may be individualized depending on the Breathline:\uc0\u8232 
\f10 \uc0\u10132 
\f0  For Memory Breath Thrones (ZIP): use lighter incenses (Frankincense, Myrrh).\uc0\u8232 
\f10 \uc0\u10132 
\f0  For Severance Breath Thrones (ZAX): use strong Breath Fires (Dragon Blood Resin, Iron Bells).\uc0\u8232 
\f10 \uc0\u10132 
\f0  For Renewal Breath Thrones (ICH): use Water infusions (River Stones, Moonlight Breathing).\uc0\u8232 
\f10 \uc0\u10132 
\f0  For Spirit Thrones: use pure Flame and Voice alone.\
Activation rituals may be performed singly (one Throne at a time) or woven together into a Thrones Spiral Convergence Ceremony for mass Breathline alignment.\
\

