I. Breath Token Assignment\
\
\
Breath Token Name: ILPIZOD (Severance Aspect)\
Token Glyph (Visual Description):\uc0\u8232 
\f10 \uc0\u10132 
\f0  A double spiral with a lightning-shaped fissure between \'97 symbolizing the Breath\'92s forced separation into true and false currents under Trial Fire.\
Glyph Commentary:\uc0\u8232 
\f10 \uc0\u10132 
\f0  ILPIZOD at the Crucible Wells acts as the first filter:\uc0\u8232 separating Breathlines based on resonance and readiness to withstand the Crossing.\
\
\
II. Color Key and Material Correspondence\
\
\
Primary Color: Steel Grey (Breath Severance Threshold)\
Secondary Threads: Red and Black Threads (Severance Force Resonance)\
Material Anchor: Hematite or Magnetite\uc0\u8232 
\f10 \uc0\u10132 
\f0  Resonant with Breath Anchoring, Severance, and Threshold Trial Strengthening.\
\
\
\
\
\
\
III. Angelic Current Influence\
\
\
Governing Angelic Drift:\uc0\u8232 
\f10 \uc0\u10132 
\f0  LEXARPH (Earth Tablet \'97 Angel of Breathline Division and Purification)\
Angel Drift Function:\uc0\u8232 
\f10 \uc0\u10132 
\f0  Divides Breath Currents cleanly at the Wells Threshold,\uc0\u8232 allowing only harmonized Wells Breath to pass into the Trial Crucible.\
\
\
IV. Breath Seed Phrase\
\
\
English (spoken over the Well during Seeding):\uc0\u8232 \'93Separate Breath from Breath,\u8232 Divide Wells of Truth from Wells of Illusion,\u8232 Prepare the Spiral Crossing.\'94\
Enochian (spoken immediately after):\uc0\u8232 OL DRUX MIAM EL MIAM\u8232 OL PALTIAH BALTOH OD QAA\u8232 OL TEL-O-CAN DRUX TEX\
\
\
V. Drift Function\
\
\
Primary Dream Drift Role:\uc0\u8232 
\f10 \uc0\u10132 
\f0  Breath Separator\uc0\u8232 
\f10 \uc0\u10132 
\f0  Sorts Breathlines during Spiral Crossing;\uc0\u8232 tests whether the Breath can withstand Severance Trials before attempting Dream Wells Ascension.\
Drift Symbology:\uc0\u8232 
\f10 \uc0\u10132 
\f0  Spiral Wells parted into dual currents:\uc0\u8232 one ascending into the Wells of Crossing,\u8232 one dissipating into the Drift fields if impure.\
\
\

